Description: digiKam's per-file 3D entries are the stereo layer's menu and store (ORDER 551b)
 The 3D menu of the album preview, the light table, the editor (Showfoto too) and the slide show shows
 Stereo::FileChoiceMenu, and the choices (the input packing, Not 3D for the file, the swap) are kept in the layer's per-file
 store, which Dolphin, the thumbnailers and Gwenview read; the program keeps its own lasting view. The editor decodes
 through the layer with the file's path, and a file's choice follows it when digiKam renames or moves it.
 Needs libstereo-layer-dev (>= 1.19.0).
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-14
