+/* ============================================================
+ *
+ * This file is a part of digiKam project
+ * https://www.digikam.org
+ *
+ * SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 by Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
